Optimal Solution - Extract fixed-position age digits and count passengers whose age exceeds 60 using constant-time character arithmetic.

class Solution {
    public int countSeniors(String[] details) {
        int res = 0;  // Count of senior citizens
        // Traverse each passenger detail
        for (String detail : details) {
            // Extract age substring (positions 11 and 12)
            int age = Integer.parseInt(detail.substring(11, 13));
            // Check if age > 60
            if (age > 60) {
                res++;
            }
        }
        return res;  // Return total seniors
    }
}

Time Complexity :- O(N).
Space Complexity :- O(1).
